## code-et workflow

| Task | Command |
|---|---|
| Single bug fix | `/code:fix` → implement → `/commit-push-pr` |
| Feature | `/code:plan` → `/code:ship` → `/code:review` → `/commit-push-pr` |
| Add CI to existing repo | `/code:install-ci` |

Each task carries `metadata.module` (free-form module name) — vertical slices typically touch the HTTP seam plus one or two modules.
